{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >London: Echoes of The Past is a short yuri mystery visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious woman returns back from the dead, and the dusty past surfaces. Between a gloomy school girl and a glamorous ex-girlfriend,  every clue interwines. Who is the mastermind behind the scene? Play as a detective heroine in 1935 London, embark on a journey of love and growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/952d97ed7f3187e5a75d0a6989034b66.avif?t=1762148887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/952d97ed7f3187e5a75d0a6989034b66.avif?t=1762148887 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, intelligent private detective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agent with a secret mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Could it be that every reunions is just another deadly gamble elaborated by the fate?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/f2cf2a6dbb74e78669f410d1b1640271.avif?t=1762148887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/f2cf2a6dbb74e78669f410d1b1640271.avif?t=1762148887 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stubborn, lively young girl with a strange obsession with He Yaqiong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A student client who awaked the dusty memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIt's hard to say, things are unpredictable, some things always change. Don't you think so?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/291411c19652a17b1ebe8285a07882dc.avif?t=1762148887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/291411c19652a17b1ebe8285a07882dc.avif?t=1762148887 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle, elegant, glamorous and mysterious ex-girlfriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified international businesswoman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI've often wondered what kind of person you would become, Ya. Thank you for giving me the answer.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre Commissions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost and Found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tangible riddles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A foreign land, an old friend, a strange case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the connection among them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a time for justice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bullet takes flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you pierce through the fog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuri Mystery Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90,000 Words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cel Shading Backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ CGs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725910?t=1762148887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/5eb61e2ecd03c9b35cd89ac8c5c045e990e2d170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762148887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/5b9b880566c23ce8